-- mod-hearthstone: the Battlegrounds weekly quests.
-- Static turn-ins at the two Battlegrounds hosts, runtime starts (one of each tier per week). Credit templates have
-- no spawns. Needs the Battlegrounds rules quest turned in (migration 0062).
